  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The year is 2000, and you are in a post-industrial mining town. Mining
    has destroyed the wildlife in the area, severely affecting the towns\u2019 peoples\u2019
    livelihoods.\n\nThe residents have decided to raise money to help restore these
    areas of the town and open a remembrance garden. This campaign caused a boom
    in businesses, particularly florists. Daisy, the main character, is being asked
    to take over from her mother's florist due to old age.\n\nAs the player you spend
    your day to day completing bouquet orders through a sorting minigame, exploring
    the forest for new wild flowers to learn and grow.\n\nYour goal, as Daisy, is
    to grow and sell flowers, harvesting them from the local forest. You need to
    make more profit than the competitor florist, Thorn, who is eager to put you
    out of business. Happy selling !"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b88faca29eddfc45acdae06d2d64633, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2336789279766900298, guid: 8b88faca29eddfc45acdae06d2d64633, type: 2}
